    en: "For now, this is only an idea for an open, reusable toolkit: going from scattered materials and data to a public website and an internal coordination space, with support for each group to make it their own. This diagram is here to imagine and discuss, not a fixed plan.",
};
const layers: {
    tag: Bilingual;
    title: Bilingual;
    text: Bilingual;
    status: Bilingual;
